      "review_summary": "This PR changes `src/transcripts/store.ts` to name the transcript read stream and call `lines.close()` plus `stream.destroy()` from a `finally` block in the bounded `maxUtterances` JSONL reader.\n\nPR surface: Source +6. Total +6 across 1 file.\n\nReproducibility: yes. Current main has a source-level reproduction path: the bounded transcript reader opens a file stream, parses JSONL inside the async iteration, and can throw before any explicit stream cleanup.",
      "review_followup": "- [P2] A repair worker can make the code-level blocker concrete by awaiting stream close and adding focused cleanup coverage without a product decision.",
